  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## [2.4.6.3] - 2026-01-28\n\n### Changed\n\n- Previously watching an event would only subscribe to the event on the device the first time.\n  Since some events require a new subscription in certain cases, this could lead to missing events.\n  An example is `bluetoothLinkQuality` that requires a new subscription for each new call.\n  The subscription is now performed each time a watch is started.\n\n### Added\n\n- Support for the `intToString` and `stringToInt` operators in property definitions.",
